// The json component module: a JSON tree, read only in each value's main
// view, edited in place in its edit view (components/json in tutuca's JS).
// JsonEditor pushes its mode's view above the tree, so "edit" switches the
// whole tree; values without an edit view keep main.
//
// Every value type answers the property json with its value as compact JSON
// text, which the collections compose and JsonEditor indents. This file has
// what the types share: their strings, the classes their views use, and
// helpers.

